# MovieLens Recommendation System

## Run the analysis

From the project root, run:

```powershell
python run_all.py
```

The launcher runs `Section1/section1.py`, which prints dataset statistics and recommendation evaluation results and opens the analysis plots. The ratings data file must be available at `datasets/ratings.dat`.

All generated plots are saved as PNG files under `figures/Section1/`.

Install the required Python packages from the project root:

```powershell
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
```
